{"type":"click","text":"A\n    \n      Override field in AppState RECOMMENDED\n      Add a Arc<RwLock<Option<ThinkingLevel>>> to AppState. The react_loop checks this override first, falling back to the engine's static config. A new PATCH /api/system/thinking-level endpoint sets it.\n      \n        \n          Pros\n          \n            Minimal change to engine internals\n            Clear \"override\" semantics\n            Easy to reset (set to None)\n          \n        \n        \n          Cons\n          \n            Two places to check for thinking level (override → config fallback)","choice":"a","id":null,"timestamp":1773494832844}
